Quantum teleportation, as listed in AG2004 Section IV.
Qubit 0 holds the state to teleport; qubits 1 and 2 are the EPR pair
(Alice's and Bob's halves); qubits 3 and 4 hold copies of Alice's
measurement results, which Bob uses to correct qubit 2.
